        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Field-induced SMM. χMT at 300 K is 56.42 cm3 K mol−1 (theory 56.68), decreasing to 50.34 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K under 1 kOe, consistent with crystal-field depopulation and possible antiferromagnetic Dy–Dy interactions. Magnetization at 2.0 K and 70 kOe reaches 20.37 Nβ, below saturation, indicating anisotropy. No out-of-phase ac signal under zero dc field (QTM); optimal dc field 1 kOe. Cole–Cole α = 0.0750–0.4827. Orbach+Raman fit: Ueff = 42.9 K, τ0 = 7.81×10−7 s, n = 3.2, C = 0.9 s−1 K−n.",
